Tag: role::developer
Description: Clang 19 as the default clang on PATH
 Puts clang / clang++ / clang-cpp (and cc / c++) on PATH pointing at
 clang-19. Provides c-compiler and friends, and replaces Procursus clang
 meta so packages depending on clang pick this up.
